      "schema:description": {
        "value": "The synthetic Cora dataset is provided by (Zhu et al., 2020). They generate graphs for a target homophily level using a modified preferential attachment process. Nodes, edges, and features are sampled from Cora to create a synthetic graph with a desired homogeneity and feature/label distribution.",
